    "title": "Century Party Invitation",
    "pageid": 108980,
    "revid": 833116,
    "text": "<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><div class=\"messagebox\" style=\"\">\n<div class=\"messagebox-main\">\n<div class=\"messagebox-image nomobile\" style=\"\">\n<p><span class=\"notpageimage\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/w/File:Jukebox.png\" class=\"mw-file-description\"><img src=\"/images/thumb/Jukebox.png/64px-Jukebox.png?19bed\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"64\" height=\"64\" class=\"mw-file-element\" srcset=\"/images/thumb/Jukebox.png/128px-Jukebox.png?19bed 2x\" data-file-width=\"300\" data-file-height=\"300\" /></a></span>\n</p>\n</div>\n<div class=\"messagebox-text\" style=\"\">\n<p><b>Century Raffle Exclusive</b><br />\n<b>Century Party Invitation</b> is only obtainable during <a href=\"/w/Raffle_of_the_Century\" title=\"Raffle of the Century\">century celebrations</a>.\n</p>\n</div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"messagebox-aside\">\n</div>\n</div> \n<div class=\"infobox\"><div class=\"infobox-title\">Century Party Invitation</div><div class=\"infobox-panel\"><ul class=\"infobox-section-labels\"><li class=\"label-active\" style=\"display:none\"></li></ul><div class=\"section active\"><div class=\"infobox-row-container\"><div class=\"infobox-row-value\">\n<div style=\"text-align: center;\"><span><span class=\"mw-default-size pi-image-thumbnail\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/w/File:Enchanted_Paper.png\" class=\"mw-file-description\" title=\"Century Party Invitation.png\"><img alt=\"Century Party Invitation.png\" src=\"/images/Enchanted_Paper.png?2202a\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"160\" height=\"160\" class=\"mw-file-element\" data-file-width=\"160\" data-file-height=\"160\" /></a></span></span></div></div></div><div class=\"infobox-row-container\"><div class=\"infobox-row-value\">\n<div style=\"text-align: center;\"><div class=\"\"><div class=\"mcui-row\"><span class=\"invslot\"><span class=\"invslot-item invslot-item-image\" data-minetip-style=\"rare\" data-minetip-title=\"&amp;9Century Party Invitation\" data-minetip-text=\"&amp;7Click on a player while holding this/&amp;7item to add their SkyBlock Level/&amp;7color to this item.//&amp;7Find one of each SkyBlock Level/&amp;7color to reset this item and/&amp;7permanently gain &amp;3+1☯ Social Wisdom/&amp;7and &amp;6250,000 Coins&amp;7.//&amp;7Level colors missing:/&amp;8&#91;&amp;70&amp;8&#93; - &#91;&amp;739&amp;8&#93; &amp;7Gray/&amp;8&#91;&amp;f40&amp;8&#93; - &#91;&amp;f79&amp;8&#93; &amp;fWhite/&amp;8&#91;&amp;e80&amp;8&#93; - &#91;&amp;e119&amp;8&#93; &amp;eYellow/&amp;8&#91;&amp;a120&amp;8&#93; - &#91;&amp;a159&amp;8&#93; &amp;aGreen/&amp;8&#91;&amp;2160&amp;8&#93; - &#91;&amp;2199&amp;8&#93; &amp;2Dark Green/&amp;8&#91;&amp;b200&amp;8&#93; - &#91;&amp;b239&amp;8&#93; &amp;bAqua/&amp;8&#91;&amp;3240&amp;8&#93; - &#91;&amp;3279&amp;8&#93; &amp;3Cyan/&amp;8&#91;&amp;9280&amp;8&#93; - &#91;&amp;9319&amp;8&#93; &amp;9Blue/&amp;8&#91;&amp;d320&amp;8&#93; - &#91;&amp;d359&amp;8&#93; &amp;dPink/&amp;8&#91;&amp;5360&amp;8&#93; - &#91;&amp;5399&amp;8&#93; &amp;5Purple/&amp;8&#91;&amp;6400&amp;8&#93; - &#91;&amp;6439&amp;8&#93; &amp;6Gold/&amp;8&#91;&amp;c440&amp;8&#93; - &#91;&amp;c479&amp;8&#93; &amp;cRed//&amp;8You may only gain the bonus once!//&amp;9&amp;lRARE\"><span typeof=\"mw:File\"><span title=\"Century Party Invitation\"><img alt=\"Century Party Invitation.png\" src=\"/images/thumb/Enchanted_Paper.png/32px-Enchanted_Paper.png?2202a\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"32\" height=\"32\" class=\"mw-file-element\" srcset=\"/images/thumb/Enchanted_Paper.png/64px-Enchanted_Paper.png?2202a 2x\" data-file-width=\"160\" data-file-height=\"160\" /></span></span></span></span></div></div></div></div></div><div class=\"infobox-row-container\"><div class=\"infobox-row-label\">Type</div><div class=\"infobox-row-value\">\nItem</div></div><div class=\"infobox-row-container\"><div class=\"infobox-row-label\">Rarity</div><div class=\"infobox-row-value\">\n<span data-sort-value=\"2\"><a href=\"/w/Rarity#Rare\" title=\"Rarity\"><span class=\"hsw-gamefont raritytier\"><span class=\"color-blue\" style=\"\">RARE</span></span></a></span></div></div><div class=\"group layout-horizontal\" style=\"display:grid;grid-template-columns:repeat(2, 1fr);grid-column:1 / -1\"><div class=\"infobox-header\">Item Properties</div><div class=\"infobox-row-container\"><div class=\"infobox-row-label\"><abbr title=\"Whether or not the item(s) can be sold to an NPC. If an item is not salable but has enchantments on it, it becomes salable.\" tabindex=\"0\">Salable</abbr></div><div class=\"infobox-row-value\">\n<span class=\"mcui-text\" style=\"display: inline; font-size: 12px;\"><span class=\"format-c\">✕</span></span> <span class=\"color-red\" style=\"\"><b>No</b></span></div></div><div class=\"infobox-row-container\"><div class=\"infobox-row-label\">Tradeable</div><div class=\"infobox-row-value\">\n<span class=\"mcui-text\" style=\"display: inline; font-size: 12px;\"><span class=\"format-a\">✔</span></span> <span class=\"light-color color-green\" style=\"\"><b>Yes</b></span></div></div><div class=\"infobox-row-container\"><div class=\"infobox-row-label\">Auctionable</div><div class=\"infobox-row-value\">\n<span class=\"mcui-text\" style=\"display: inline; font-size: 12px;\"><span class=\"format-a\">✔</span></span> <span class=\"light-color color-green\" style=\"\"><b>Yes</b></span></div></div><div class=\"infobox-row-container\"><div class=\"infobox-row-label\"><abbr title=\"Whether or not the item(s) can be donated to the Museum\" tabindex=\"0\">Museum</abbr></div><div class=\"infobox-row-value\">\n<span class=\"mcui-text\" style=\"display: inline; font-size: 12px;\"><span class=\"format-c\">✕</span></span> <span class=\"color-red\" style=\"\"><b>No</b></span></div></div></div><div class=\"group layout-horizontal\" style=\"display:grid;grid-template-columns:repeat(2, 1fr);grid-column:1 / -1\"><div class=\"infobox-header\">Auction House <span style=\"text-decoration:underline dashed\"><span class=\"plainlinks\"><a target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow noreferrer noopener\" class=\"external text\" href=\"https://sky.coflnet.com/item/CENTURY_PARTY_INVITATION\">Prices</a></span></span><b><sup><abbr class=\"auction-house-info-icon auction-house-info-icon-no-time\" title=\"Values are updated every 15 minutes from Hypixel&#39;s API.\">ⓘ</abbr></sup></b></div><div class=\"infobox-row-container\"><div class=\"infobox-row-label\">Lowest <abbr title=\"Buy It Now price\">BIN</abbr><br />(Latest)</div><div class=\"infobox-row-value\">\n<span data-auction-house=\"eyJvcGVyYXRpb24iOiJpdGVtUHJpY2UiLCJ0eXBlIjoiY3VycmVudCIsImNvaW4iOnRydWUsIml0ZW1JZCI6IkNFTlRVUllfUEFSVFlfSU5WSVRBVElPTiJ9\" class=\"auction-house-data-placeholder auction-house-data-operation-itemPrice\"><abbr title=\"This content is populated from a JavaScript gadget, LivePriceData. If it does not load right away, check that the gadget is enabled in your preferences, reload the page, and contact an administrator if the issue persists or occurs regularly.\"><span class=\"color-gold\" style=\"\">???&#160;Coins</span></abbr></span></div></div><div class=\"infobox-row-container\"><div class=\"infobox-row-label\">Lowest <abbr title=\"Buy It Now price\">BIN</abbr><br />(Daily Average)</div><div class=\"infobox-row-value\">\n<span data-auction-house=\"eyJvcGVyYXRpb24iOiJpdGVtUHJpY2UiLCJ0eXBlIjoiYXZlcmFnZSIsImNvaW4iOnRydWUsIml0ZW1JZCI6IkNFTlRVUllfUEFSVFlfSU5WSVRBVElPTiJ9\" class=\"auction-house-data-placeholder auction-house-data-operation-itemPrice\"><abbr title=\"This content is populated from a JavaScript gadget, LivePriceData. If it does not load right away, check that the gadget is enabled in your preferences, reload the page, and contact an administrator if the issue persists or occurs regularly.\"><span class=\"color-gold\" style=\"\">???&#160;Coins</span></abbr></span></div></div></div><div class=\"group\" style=\"display:grid;grid-template-columns:repeat(1, 1fr);grid-column:1 / -1\"><div class=\"infobox-header\">Item Metadata</div><div class=\"infobox-row-container\"><div class=\"infobox-row-label\">Item ID</div><div class=\"infobox-row-value\">\n<code>CENTURY_PARTY_INVITATION</code></div></div></div></div></div></div>\n<p>The <b>Century Party Invitation</b> is a <span data-sort-value=\"2\"><a href=\"/w/Rarity#Rare\" title=\"Rarity\"><span class=\"hsw-gamefont raritytier\"><span class=\"color-blue\" style=\"\">RARE</span></span></a></span> item.\n</p>\n<div class=\"mw-heading mw-heading2\"><h2 id=\"Obtaining\">Obtaining</h2><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/w/Century_Party_Invitation?section=1&amp;veaction=edit\" title=\"Edit section: Obtaining\" class=\"mw-editsection-visualeditor\"><span>edit</span></a><span class=\"mw-editsection-divider\"> | </span><a href=\"/w/Century_Party_Invitation?action=edit&amp;section=1\" title=\"Edit section&#039;s source code: Obtaining\"><span>edit source</span></a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></div>\n<p><b>Century Party Invitation</b> can be obtained as a Minor Reward during <a href=\"/w/Raffle_of_the_Century\" title=\"Raffle of the Century\">Raffle of the Century</a> event, or from the <span class=\"spriteicon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/w/Gift_Bag_of_the_Century\" title=\"Gift Bag of the Century\"><img src=\"/images/thumb/Gift_Bag_of_the_Century.png/21px-Gift_Bag_of_the_Century.png?68bdb\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"21\" height=\"21\" class=\"mw-file-element\" srcset=\"/images/thumb/Gift_Bag_of_the_Century.png/42px-Gift_Bag_of_the_Century.png?68bdb 2x\" data-file-width=\"300\" data-file-height=\"300\" /></a></span>&#160;<a href=\"/w/Gift_Bag_of_the_Century\" title=\"Gift Bag of the Century\">Gift Bag of the Century</a>.\n</p>\n<div class=\"mw-heading mw-heading2\"><h2 id=\"Usage\">Usage</h2><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/w/Century_Party_Invitation?section=2&amp;veaction=edit\" title=\"Edit section: Usage\" class=\"mw-editsection-visualeditor\"><span>edit</span></a><span class=\"mw-editsection-divider\"> | </span><a href=\"/w/Century_Party_Invitation?action=edit&amp;section=2\" title=\"Edit section&#039;s source code: Usage\"><span>edit source</span></a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></div>\n<p>The player can click on any other player while holding a <b>Century Party Invitation</b> to add the level color to the item.\n</p>\n<div class=\"textsection-boxed\" style=\"\">\n<div class=\"mcdialogue\" style=\"\"><div class=\"mcdialogue-line\"><span class=\"format-d\"><span class=\"format-l\">PARTY! </span></span><span class=\"format-b\">&lt;player&gt;</span><span class=\"format-e\">'s SkyBlock level color is </span><span class=\"format-8\">[</span><span class=\"format-b\">&lt;level&gt;</span><span class=\"format-8\">] - [</span><span class=\"format-b\">&lt;level&gt;</span><span class=\"format-8\">] </span><span class=\"format-b\">&lt;color&gt;</span><span class=\"format-f\">!</span></div><div class=\"mcdialogue-line\"><span class=\"format-a\">You invited </span><span class=\"format-b\">&lt;player&gt; </span><span class=\"format-a\">to the </span><span class=\"format-d\">Century Party</span><span class=\"format-a\">!</span></div></div>\n</div>\n<p>If the level color has already been found, the result will be:\n</p>\n<div class=\"textsection-boxed\" style=\"\">\n<div class=\"mcdialogue\" style=\"\"><div class=\"mcdialogue-line\"><span class=\"format-d\"><span class=\"format-l\">PARTY! </span></span><span class=\"format-b\">&lt;player&gt;</span><span class=\"format-e\">'s SkyBlock level color is </span><span class=\"format-8\">[</span><span class=\"format-b\">&lt;level&gt;</span><span class=\"format-8\">] - [</span><span class=\"format-b\">&lt;level&gt;</span><span class=\"format-8\">] </span><span class=\"format-b\">&lt;color&gt;</span><span class=\"format-f\">!</span></div><div class=\"mcdialogue-line\"><span class=\"format-c\">You already have this SkyBlock level color in your invitation!</span></div></div>\n</div>\n<p>Finding each level color will reset the item and grant the player a permanent <span class=\"hsw-gamefont\"><span class=\"color-dark&#95;aqua\" style=\"\">+1</span>&#160;<a href=\"/w/Social_Wisdom\" title=\"Social Wisdom\"><span class=\"color-dark&#95;aqua\" style=\"\"><span aria-hidden=\"true\">☯&#160;</span>Social Wisdom</span></a></span> and <span><span class=\"color-gold\" style=\"\"><span>250,000</span></span> <a href=\"/w/Coins\" title=\"Coins\"><span class=\"color-gold\" style=\"\">Coins</span></a></span>. The player may only gain the bonus once.\n</p>\n<div class=\"textsection-boxed\" style=\"\">\n<div class=\"mcdialogue\" style=\"\"><div class=\"mcdialogue-line\"><span class=\"format-d\"><span class=\"format-l\">PARTY! </span></span><span class=\"format-a\">Your Century Party has reached max capacity, and you gained its permanent bonus!</span></div><div class=\"mcdialogue-line\"><span class=\"format-e\">That also comes with a one-time reward of </span><span class=\"format-6\">250,000 Coins</span><span class=\"format-e\">!</span></div></div>\n</div>\n<p>The bonus is a one time reward. If the player finds all level color again they will receive nothing but a message in chat.\n</p>\n<div class=\"textsection-boxed\" style=\"\">\n<div class=\"mcdialogue\" style=\"\"><div class=\"mcdialogue-line\"><span class=\"format-d\"><span class=\"format-l\">PARTY! </span></span><span class=\"format-a\">Your Party has reached max capacity!</span></div><div class=\"mcdialogue-line\"><span class=\"format-a\">You had already gained the bonus, so... at least everyone is now invited!</span></div></div>\n</div>\n<p>All level color can be seen below.\n</p>\n<table class=\"wikitable\">\n<tbody><tr>\n<th>Colors\n</th></tr>\n<tr>\n<td><span class=\"color-dark&#95;gray\" style=\"\">[</span><span class=\"color-gray\" style=\"\">0</span><span class=\"color-dark&#95;gray\" style=\"\">]</span>  <span class=\"color-dark&#95;gray\" style=\"\">- [</span><span class=\"color-gray\" style=\"\">39</span><span class=\"color-dark&#95;gray\" style=\"\">]</span> <span class=\"color-gray\" style=\"\">Gray</span>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td><span class=\"color-dark&#95;gray\" style=\"\">[</span><span class=\"light-color color-white\" style=\"\">40</span><span class=\"color-dark&#95;gray\" style=\"\">]</span>  <span class=\"color-dark&#95;gray\" style=\"\">- [</span><span class=\"light-color color-white\" style=\"\">79</span><span class=\"color-dark&#95;gray\" style=\"\">]</span> <span class=\"light-color color-white\" style=\"\">White</span>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td><span class=\"color-dark&#95;gray\" style=\"\">[</span><span class=\"light-color color-yellow\" style=\"\">80</span><span class=\"color-dark&#95;gray\" style=\"\">]</span>  <span class=\"color-dark&#95;gray\" style=\"\">- [</span><span class=\"light-color color-yellow\" style=\"\">119</span><span class=\"color-dark&#95;gray\" style=\"\">]</span> <span class=\"light-color color-yellow\" style=\"\">Yellow</span>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td><span class=\"color-dark&#95;gray\" style=\"\">[</span><span class=\"light-color color-green\" style=\"\">120</span><span class=\"color-dark&#95;gray\" style=\"\">]</span>  <span class=\"color-dark&#95;gray\" style=\"\">- [</span><span class=\"light-color color-green\" style=\"\">159</span><span class=\"color-dark&#95;gray\" style=\"\">]</span> <span class=\"light-color color-green\" style=\"\">Green</span>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td><span class=\"color-dark&#95;gray\" style=\"\">[</span><span class=\"color-dark&#95;green\" style=\"\">160</span><span class=\"color-dark&#95;gray\" style=\"\">]</span>  <span class=\"color-dark&#95;gray\" style=\"\">- [</span><span class=\"color-dark&#95;green\" style=\"\">199</span><span class=\"color-dark&#95;gray\" style=\"\">]</span> <span class=\"color-dark&#95;green\" style=\"\">Dark Green</span>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td><span class=\"color-dark&#95;gray\" style=\"\">[</span><span class=\"light-color color-aqua\" style=\"\">200</span><span class=\"color-dark&#95;gray\" style=\"\">]</span>  <span class=\"color-dark&#95;gray\" style=\"\">- [</span><span class=\"light-color color-aqua\" style=\"\">239</span><span class=\"color-dark&#95;gray\" style=\"\">]</span> <span class=\"light-color color-aqua\" style=\"\">Aqua</span>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td><span class=\"color-dark&#95;gray\" style=\"\">[</span><span class=\"color-dark&#95;aqua\" style=\"\">240</span><span class=\"color-dark&#95;gray\" style=\"\">]</span>  <span class=\"color-dark&#95;gray\" style=\"\">- [</span><span class=\"color-dark&#95;aqua\" style=\"\">279</span><span class=\"color-dark&#95;gray\" style=\"\">]</span> <span class=\"color-dark&#95;aqua\" style=\"\">Cyan</span>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td><span class=\"color-dark&#95;gray\" style=\"\">[</span><span class=\"color-blue\" style=\"\">280</span><span class=\"color-dark&#95;gray\" style=\"\">]</span>  <span class=\"color-dark&#95;gray\" style=\"\">- [</span><span class=\"color-blue\" style=\"\">319</span><span class=\"color-dark&#95;gray\" style=\"\">]</span> <span class=\"color-blue\" style=\"\">Blue</span>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td><span class=\"color-dark&#95;gray\" style=\"\">[</span><span class=\"\" style=\"color:#FF55FF\">320</span><span class=\"color-dark&#95;gray\" style=\"\">]</span>  <span class=\"color-dark&#95;gray\" style=\"\">- [</span><span class=\"\" style=\"color:#FF55FF\">359</span><span class=\"color-dark&#95;gray\" style=\"\">]</span> <span class=\"\" style=\"color:#FF55FF\">Pink</span>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td><span class=\"color-dark&#95;gray\" style=\"\">[</span><span class=\"color-dark&#95;purple\" style=\"\">360</span><span class=\"color-dark&#95;gray\" style=\"\">]</span>  <span class=\"color-dark&#95;gray\" style=\"\">- [</span><span class=\"color-dark&#95;purple\" style=\"\">399</span><span class=\"color-dark&#95;gray\" style=\"\">]</span> <span class=\"color-dark&#95;purple\" style=\"\">Purple</span>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td><span class=\"color-dark&#95;gray\" style=\"\">[</span><span class=\"color-gold\" style=\"\">400</span><span class=\"color-dark&#95;gray\" style=\"\">]</span>  <span class=\"color-dark&#95;gray\" style=\"\">- [</span><span class=\"color-gold\" style=\"\">439</span><span class=\"color-dark&#95;gray\" style=\"\">]</span> <span class=\"color-gold\" style=\"\">Gold</span>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td><span class=\"color-dark&#95;gray\" style=\"\">[</span><span class=\"color-red\" style=\"\">440</span><span class=\"color-dark&#95;gray\" style=\"\">]</span>  <span class=\"color-dark&#95;gray\" style=\"\">- [</span><span class=\"color-red\" style=\"\">479</span><span class=\"color-dark&#95;gray\" style=\"\">]</span> <span class=\"color-red\" style=\"\">Red</span>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td><span class=\"color-dark&#95;gray\" style=\"\">[</span><span class=\"color-dark&#95;red\" style=\"\">480</span><span class=\"color-dark&#95;gray\" style=\"\">]+</span> <span class=\"color-dark&#95;red\" style=\"\">Dark Red</span>\n</td></tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<div class=\"mw-heading mw-heading2\"><h2 id=\"History\">History</h2><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/w/Century_Party_Invitation?section=3&amp;veaction=edit\" title=\"Edit section: History\" class=\"mw-editsection-visualeditor\"><span>edit</span></a><span class=\"mw-editsection-divider\"> | </span><a href=\"/w/Century_Party_Invitation?action=edit&amp;section=3\" title=\"Edit section&#039;s source code: History\"><span>edit source</span></a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></div>\n<table class=\"wikitable pixelated\" data-description=\"History\"><tbody><tr><th colspan=\"3\"><a href=\"/w/SkyBlock_Prototype\" title=\"SkyBlock Prototype\">SkyBlock Prototype</a></th></tr><tr><th rowspan=\"1\">Feb&#160;1,&#160;2025</th><th rowspan=\"1\">0.21.2</th><td><span typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/w/File:Paper.png\" class=\"mw-file-description\"><img src=\"/images/thumb/Paper.png/26px-Paper.png?79e52\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"26\" height=\"26\" class=\"mw-file-element\" srcset=\"/images/thumb/Paper.png/52px-Paper.png?79e52 2x\" data-file-width=\"160\" data-file-height=\"160\" /></a></span> Added <b>Century Party Invitation</b>.</td></tr>\n<tr><th rowspan=\"1\"><a href=\"/w/Changelog/2025/October_15\" title=\"Changelog/2025/October 15\">Oct&#160;15,&#160;2025</a></th><th rowspan=\"1\">0.23.5</th><td>Added the Dark Red level bracket to the <b>Century Party Invitation</b> item.</td></tr></tbody></table>\n<!-- \nNewPP limit report\nParsed by mediawiki‐jobrunner‐847db4cdb‐s28qf\nCached time: 20261023053507\nCache expiry: 172800\nReduced expiry: false\nComplications: [vary‐revision]\nCPU time usage: 1.507 seconds\nReal time usage: 2.251 seconds\nPreprocessor visited node count: 1573/1000000\nRevision size: 4004/8388608 bytes\nPost‐expand include size: 32770/8388608 bytes\nTemplate argument size: 3346/8388608 bytes\nHighest expansion depth: 11/100\nExpensive parser function count: 1/500\nUnstrip recursion depth: 0/20\nUnstrip post‐expand size: 0/5000000 bytes\nExtLoops count: 0/50\nBucket time usage: 0.002/10 seconds\nLua time usage: 1.382/10.000 seconds\nLua memory usage: 29977628/367001600 bytes\nLua Profile:\n    ?                                                                480 ms       34.8%\n    format                                                           100 ms        7.2%\n    MediaWiki\\Extension\\Scribunto\\Engines\\LuaSandbox\\LuaSandboxCallback::parseFormattedNumber       80 ms        5.8%\n    gsub                                                              60 ms        4.3%\n    validateData <mw.lua:825>                                         40 ms        2.9%\n    tostring                                                          40 ms        2.9%\n    merge <Module:Table:151>                                          40 ms        2.9%\n    dataWrapper <mw.lu